OL,3,GNEWSABridge damaged by vehicle to be
OL,4,Arepaired
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II listed bridge that was
OL,7,Fdamaged when a vehicle struck it is to
OL,8,Fbe repaired.
OL,10,FThe collision damaged the cast-iron
OL,11,Fparapet of Lockwood Street Bridge, west
OL,12,FHull, in November 2025.
OL,14,FConstructed in 1877, the bridge spans
OL,15,Fthe Beverley and Barmston Drain and
OL,16,Fconnects Lockwood Street to Barmston
OL,17,FStreet.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
