OL,3,GNEWSABridge damaged by vehicle to be
OL,4,Arepaired
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City Council said it was in the
OL,7,Fprocess of appointing a contractor to
OL,8,Fcarry out repair work using traditional
OL,9,Ftechniques to preserve the bridge's
OL,10,Fhistoric character.
